### Option 1: Create a Custom Converter
You can create a custom `HttpMessageConverter` to convert the XML response body to a `Doctor` object.

1. Create a custom converter:
```java
public class DoctorConverter implements HttpMessageConverter&lt;Doctor&gt;, MessageConvertable {

    @Override
    public boolean supports(Class&lt;? extends Doctor&gt; clazz) {
        return Doctor.class.equals(clazz);
    }

    @Override
    public ResponseEntity&lt;Doctor&gt; readFrom(Class&lt;Doctor&gt; type, String s, MediaType contentType) {
        // Read the XML content from the request body
        String xmlContent = s;
        return new ResponseEntity&lt;Doctor&gt;(new ObjectMapper().readValue(xmlContent, type), new HttpHeaders(), HttpStatus.OK);
    }

    @Override
    public ResponseEntity&lt;Doctor&gt; writeFrom(Doctor source, MediaType contentType) {
